@startuml sequence-success-flow
!theme plain
autonumber "<b>[00]</b>"
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam ArrowColor #1A5276
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.3

title <size:16><b>Fluxo de Sucesso (Happy Path) - Padrão Saga por Orquestração</b></size>\n<size:11>Processamento Transacional Distribuído com Consistência Eventual</size>

actor "Cliente / App" as Client #E8F8F5
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway #D4EFDF
box "Order Domain (Orquestrador)" #EBF5FB
    participant "Order Service\n(Saga Orchestrator)" as OrderService #AED6F1
    database "Order DB" as OrderDB #85C1E9
end box

participant "Message Broker\n(Kafka / RabbitMQ)" as Broker #FEF9E7

box "Inventory Domain" #EAFAF1
    participant "Inventory Service\n(Idempotent Consumer)" as InventoryService #A9DFBF
    database "Inventory DB" as InventoryDB #7DCEA0
end box

box "Payment Domain" #F4ECF7
    participant "Payment Service\n(Idempotent Consumer)" as PaymentService #D2B4DE
    database "Payment DB" as PaymentDB #BB8FCE
end box

participant "Gateway Financeiro\n(Externo)" as FinGateway #FDEDEC

== 1. Criação do Pedido e Início da Saga ==
Client -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/orders {items, total, payment_data}
Gateway -> OrderService : Encaminha requisição com TraceID / RequestID

OrderService -> OrderDB : [Transação ACID Local]\n1. INSERT INTO orders (status='PENDING')\n2. INSERT INTO saga_instance (status='STARTED')\n3. INSERT INTO outbox (cmd='ReserveStockCommand')
OrderDB --> OrderService : Commit OK (order_id, saga_id)

OrderService --> Gateway : 202 Accepted {order_id, saga_id, status='PENDING'}
Gateway --> Client : 202 Accepted (Informa processamento assíncrono)

OrderService -> Broker : [Outbox / CDC] Publica 'ReserveStockCommand'\nno tópico 'cmd.inventory.reserve'

== 2. Reserva de Estoque (Transação Pivot / Compensável) ==
Broker -> InventoryService : Entrega 'ReserveStockCommand' {order_id, items}
activate InventoryService

InventoryService -> InventoryDB : [Transação ACID Local com Idempotência]\n1. INSERT INTO processed_messages (msg_id, saga_id) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING\n2. UPDATE stock SET available = available - qty, reserved = reserved + qty\n3. INSERT INTO reservations (status='HOLD')\n4. INSERT INTO outbox (evt='StockReservedEvent')
InventoryDB --> InventoryService : Commit OK

InventoryService --> Broker : ACK de mensagem processada
deactivate InventoryService

InventoryService -> Broker : [Outbox / CDC] Publica 'StockReservedEvent'\nno tópico 'evt.inventory.reserved'

Broker -> OrderService : Entrega 'StockReservedEvent' {order_id, saga_id}
activate OrderService

OrderService -> OrderDB : [Transação ACID Local]\n1. UPDATE saga_instance SET current_step='STOCK_RESERVED'\n2. INSERT INTO saga_step_log (step='INVENTORY', status='SUCCESS')\n3. INSERT INTO outbox (cmd='ProcessPaymentCommand')
OrderDB --> OrderService : Commit OK

OrderService --> Broker : ACK de evento
deactivate OrderService

OrderService -> Broker : [Outbox / CDC] Publica 'ProcessPaymentCommand'\nno tópico 'cmd.payment.process'

== 3. Processamento de Pagamento (Transação Pivot) ==
Broker -> PaymentService : Entrega 'ProcessPaymentCommand' {order_id, amount, payment_token}
activate PaymentService

PaymentService -> PaymentDB : SELECT msg_id FROM processed_messages\n(Verifica Idempotência)
PaymentDB --> PaymentService : Não processado ainda

PaymentService -> FinGateway : POST /v1/charges {amount, token, idempotency_key}
activate FinGateway
FinGateway --> PaymentService : 200 OK {charge_id='ch_9988', status='AUTHORIZED'}
deactivate FinGateway

PaymentService -> PaymentDB : [Transação ACID Local]\n1. INSERT INTO payments (status='CAPTURED', charge_id)\n2. INSERT INTO processed_messages (msg_id, saga_id)\n3. INSERT INTO outbox (evt='PaymentCompletedEvent')
PaymentDB --> PaymentService : Commit OK

PaymentService --> Broker : ACK de mensagem processada
deactivate PaymentService

PaymentService -> Broker : [Outbox / CDC] Publica 'PaymentCompletedEvent'\nno tópico 'evt.payment.completed'

== 4. Conclusão da Saga e Confirmação do Pedido ==
Broker -> OrderService : Entrega 'PaymentCompletedEvent' {order_id, saga_id, charge_id}
activate OrderService

OrderService -> OrderDB : [Transação ACID Local]\n1. UPDATE saga_instance SET status='COMPLETED'\n2. INSERT INTO saga_step_log (step='PAYMENT', status='SUCCESS')\n3. UPDATE orders SET status='PAID_CONFIRMED'\n4. INSERT INTO outbox (evt='OrderCompletedEvent')
OrderDB --> OrderService : Commit OK

OrderService --> Broker : ACK de evento
deactivate OrderService

OrderService -> Client : [WebSocket / SSE / Push Notification]\n"Pedido #12345 Confirmado com Sucesso!"

@enduml